Run a query (text, or @file to read it from a file)

Usage: notatnik query [OPTIONS] <GRAPH> <QUERY>

Arguments:
  <GRAPH>  Graph folder
  <QUERY>  Query text, or @path

Options:
      --today <TODAY>  Treat this date as today (YYYY-MM-DD); default: the system date
      --json           Print JSON instead of text
  -h, --help           Print help
